# Evidence flow; design only. Opaque acquisitions/health remain unproved.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Frozen subject\nNormal signed host; inherited limit\nReal provider + independent clients" {class: start}
Owned: "Owned events + native envelopes\nAttempts / transfers / closes / gate\nCandidate → target walks → recheck"
Listener: "Passive real NIO hooks\nPre-suppression error / chosen delay\nSchedule / cancel / actual read"
Outcomes: "Independent outcomes\nFresh connections / durable grants\nWitnessed launch / open / reveal"
Controls: "Broken detection controls\nTransient between polls / dropped pair\nOverflow / suppressed accept error"
Loss: "Complete applicable evidence?\nSite counters / sequences / spans\nFD owner generations / open-at-cut" {shape: diamond}
Invalid: "Lost event / attribution gap\nFailed reference / altered hook behavior\nInconclusive · cannot pass"
Compare: "Matched no-search references\nControlled saturation ≠ unheld native work\nCompare operations item by item"
Verdict: "Resource failure or accept backoff?\nLater successful reply cannot erase it" {shape: diamond}
Fail: "Serviceability failure\nRepair or explicit scope decision"
Limited: "Empirical pass for named subject only\nOpaque acquisitions / peaks / errors unproved\nRuntime controls and native outcomes pending"
Start -> Owned: "1 · search"
Start -> Listener: "1 · listener"
Start -> Outcomes: "1 · clients / store / actions"
Owned -> Controls: "2 · detect"
Listener -> Controls: "2 · detect"
Controls -> Loss: "3 · reject broken controls"
Outcomes -> Loss: "3 · independent records"
Loss -> Invalid: "no"
Loss -> Compare: "yes"
Compare -> Invalid: "inconclusive"
Compare -> Verdict: "4 · complete comparison"
Verdict -> Fail: "yes"
Verdict -> Limited: "no · all named obligations met"
